627	/**
628	 * The signup → deploy funnel over the window. Visitors is IP-distinct (works even
629	 * for opted-out traffic and matches the visitor page's "unique visitors"). Signups
630	 * and deploys are scoped to accounts CREATED in the window, so the deploy/paid
631	 * conversion is measured against the same cohort — a clean "of the people who
632	 * signed up this period, how far did they get" read for the ad spend.
