/**
 * Cheap "is this IP in a cloud / hosting datacenter?" lookup, plus official
 * crawler IP-list membership. Data is the committed, generated
 * lib/bots/datacenter-ranges.json (scripts/refresh-datacenter-ranges.ts).
 *
 * Built once per process into sorted start/end arrays; each lookup is a binary
